n upgrade path from each of the last two Tech Preview releases to the GA release.\n46\t- Remediate the API-stability gap items that the GA-readiness assessment assigns to this surface.\n47\t- Keep the versioned surface consistent with the surfaces consumed by the platform's Llama Stack integrations (guardrails integration, Dashboard management) so the stability guarantee applies to them.\n48\t\n49\t## Acceptance Criteria\n50\t\n51\t- The published API surface is versioned and the versioning is visible to API consumers.\n52\t- A deprecation policy is published and covers the versioned API surface.\n53\t- Upgrade from each of the last two Tech Preview releases to the GA candidate is executed and verified in a test environment, with failures remediated.\n54\t- All API-stability gap items from the GA-readiness assessment assigned to this surface are closed or explicitly deferred with accepted rationale.\n55\t\n56\t## HLR Traceability\n57\t\n58\t- HLR-2 (P0): published API surface carries a stability guarantee — versioned APIs, deprecation policy, and a tested upgrade path from the last two TP releases.\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-809f9020a2fe957d","agent_id":"abb62d5961a044b64","session_id":"d3f3ba1a-747f-4186-8293-bb365a6cbf67","uuid":"d8146ac7-efa1-40ec-b1a8-2adb02d3593d","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:50:31.088Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-aca9615b37fde40c","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
